                                               INSTRUCTION SET REFERENCE, A-L


Virtual-8086 Mode Exceptions
Same exceptions as protected mode.

Compatibility Mode Exceptions
Same exceptions as protected mode.

64-Bit Mode Exceptions
#UD                       If in 64-bit mode.




