                                                                              xmm1 with a 128-bit round key from
                                                                              xmm2/m128.

VEX.NDS.128.66.0F38.WIG DC /r                   RVM V/V          Both AES     Perform one round of an AES encryption flow,
VAESENC xmm1, xmm2, xmm3/m128                                    and          operating on a 128-bit data (state) from
