 VCMPTRUE_USPS reg1, reg2, reg3                           VCMPPS reg1, reg2, reg3, 1FH

Operation

CASE (COMPARISON PREDICATE) OF
   0: OP3  EQ_OQ; OP5  EQ_OQ;
   1: OP3  LT_OS; OP5  LT_OS;
   2: OP3  LE_OS; OP5  LE_OS;
   3: OP3  UNORD_Q; OP5  UNORD_Q;
