             SS  NewSS;
   FI;
   IF IDT gate is 32-bit
         THEN


3-396 Vol. 2A                                                                                 INT n/INTO/INT 3--Call to Interrupt Procedure
                                                                                      INSTRUCTION SET REFERENCE, A-L


