DEST[63:0]  SRC[63:0]
DEST[127:64]  0
DEST[VLMAX-1:128] (Unmodified)

VMOVSD (VEX.NDS.128.F2.0F 11 /r: VMOVSD xmm1, xmm2, xmm3)
