MOVSHDUP--Move Packed Single-FP High and Duplicate
 Opcode/                                                 Op/   64/32-bit CPUID        Description
 Instruction                                             En    Mode      Feature
                                                                         Flag
 F3 0F 16 /r                                             RM    V/V       SSE3         Move two single-precision floating-point
