   Op/En                Operand 1                           Operand 2                 Operand 3                      Operand 4
     RM              ModRM:reg (w)                     ModRM:r/m (r)                      NA                             NA
    RVM              ModRM:reg (w)                      VEX.vvvv (r)                 ModRM:r/m (r)                       NA
     MR              ModRM:r/m (w)                     ModRM:reg (r)                      NA                             NA
     XM              ModRM:reg (w)                     ModRM:r/m (r)                      NA                             NA
