PADDSB:         __m128i _mm_adds_epi8 ( __m128i a, __m128i b)
PADDSW:         __m64 _mm_adds_pi16(__m64 m1, __m64 m2)
PADDSW:         __m128i _mm_adds_epi16 ( __m128i a, __m128i b)

