PEXTRB:         int _mm_extract_epi8 (__m128i src, const int ndx);

PEXTRD:         int _mm_extract_epi32 (__m128i src, const int ndx);
PEXTRQ:         __int64 _mm_extract_epi64 (__m128i src, const int ndx);

Flags Affected
None.

SIMD Floating-Point Exceptions
