PMADDWD:        __m128i _mm_madd_epi16 ( __m128i a, __m128i b)

Flags Affected
None.

Numeric Exceptions
None.

Other Exceptions
See Exceptions Type 4; additionally
#UD                   If VEX.L = 1.




