                                                                                         in mm2/m128.
 66 0F 38 09 /r                                          RM     V/V         SSSE3        Negate/zero/preserve packed word integers
 PSIGNW xmm1, xmm2/m128                                                                  in xmm1 depending on the corresponding sign
                                                                                         in xmm2/m128.
 0F 38 0A /r1                                            RM     V/V         SSSE3        Negate/zero/preserve packed doubleword
