INSTRUCTION SET REFERENCE, M-Z


VROUNDSD (VEX.128 encoded version)
DEST[63:0]  RoundToInteger(SRC2[63:0], ROUND_CONTROL)
DEST[127:64]  SRC1[127:64]
DEST[VLMAX-1:128]  0

