                                                                                 shifting bits from r16 in from the left.
 0F AD                  SHRD r/m16, r16, CL        MRC Valid         Valid       Shift r/m16 to right CL places while shifting
                                                                                 bits from r16 in from the left.
 0F AC                  SHRD r/m32, r32, imm8      MRI      Valid    Valid       Shift r/m32 to right imm8 places while
                                                                                 shifting bits from r32 in from the left.
 REX.W + 0F AC          SHRD r/m64, r64, imm8      MRI      Valid    N.E.        Shift r/m64 to right imm8 places while
                                                                                 shifting bits from r64 in from the left.
 0F AD                  SHRD r/m32, r32, CL        MRC Valid         Valid       Shift r/m32 to right CL places while shifting
                                                                                 bits from r32 in from the left.
 REX.W + 0F AD          SHRD r/m64, r64, CL        MRC Valid         N.E.        Shift r/m64 to right CL places while shifting
