2C ib                      SUB AL, imm8                I      Valid        Valid       Subtract imm8 from AL.
2D iw                      SUB AX, imm16               I      Valid        Valid       Subtract imm16 from AX.
2D id                      SUB EAX, imm32              I      Valid        Valid       Subtract imm32 from EAX.
