  xmmreg2 to xmmreg1                                      0110 0110:0000 1111:0011 1010: 0000 1101:11 xmmreg1
                                                          xmmreg2
  mem to xmmreg                                           0110 0110:0000 1111:0011 1010: 0000 1101: mod xmmreg r/m
 BLENDPS -- Blend Packed Single-Precision Floats
