                            Segment A                  RPL=3                                Gate A
                            CPL=3            Gate Selector B3                             DPL=3
                                                       RPL=3
                     3   Lowest Privilege

                              Code                                Call
                            Segment B        Gate Selector B1
                                                       RPL=2     Gate B
                            CPL=2                               DPL=2
                     2
                              Code
                            Segment C        Gate Selector B2
                                                       RPL=1
                            CPL=1
