                           63                                       32 31                           0


                                          Reserved                            SYSCALL EFLAGS Mask



                                                                IA32_FMASK
                           63                                                                       0


                                                     Target RIP for 64-bit Mode Calling Program


                                                                 IA32_LSTAR


                            63              48 47                   32 31                           0


                             SYSRET CS and SS   SYSCALL CS and SS                     Reserved



