                                                                parameter on
                                                                    the stack.
                        Application Program
                             Code                                   Call
                           Segment A          Gate Selector B                         Segment Sel. D1
                                                        RPL=3      Gate B                      RPL=3
                           CPL=3                                 DPL=3
                    3   Lowest Privilege




                    2
                                                                                             Access
                                                                                                  not
                                                                                             allowed


                    1
                                                             Code                                 Data
                                                 Operating Segment C       Segment Sel. D2      Segment D
                                                   System                           RPL=0
                                                           DPL=0                                DPL=0
                                                                       Access
                    0   Highest Privilege                              allowed


