                               00                                                                   R6
                               00                                                                   R5
                               00                                                                   R4
                               00                                                                   R3
                               00                                                                   R2
                               00                                                                   R1
                               00                                                                   R0

                   x87 FPU Status Register
                        13 11
                         000
                                              63           MMX Registers              0
                           TOS
