 DR1                           R/W1 = 01 (Write)                A0002H                LEN1 = 00 (1 byte)
 DR2                           R/W2 = 11 (Read/Write)           B0002H                LEN2 = 01) (2 bytes)
 DR3                           R/W3 = 01 (Write)                C0000H                LEN3 = 11 (4 bytes)
                                                           Data Accesses
                             Operation                                     Address            Access Length
                                                                                                (In Bytes)
