The core PMU's capability is similar to those described in Section 18.8 through Section 18.8.5, with some differ-
ences and enhancements summarized in Table 18-31. Additionally, the core PMU provides some enhancement to
support performance monitoring when the target workload contains instruction streams using Intel® Transactional
