                                                                  A
                                                 Counter Mask I E N I P     U
                                                              N     N   E O S Unit Mask (UMASK)    Event Select
                                                  (CMASK)     V N Y T C   S R



            IN_TXCP--In Tx exclude abort
            IN_TX--In Trans. Rgn
            INV--Invert counter mask
            EN--Enable counters
             ANY--Any Thread
             INT--APIC interrupt enable
             PC--Pin control                                                                       Reserved
             E--Edge detect
