support architectural performance-monitoring events listed in Table 19-1. Non-architectural performance-moni-
toring events in the processor core are listed in Table 19-5. The events in Table 19-5 apply to processors with
CPUID signature of DisplayFamily_DisplayModel encoding with the following values: 06_3AH.


