19.4       PERFORMANCE MONITORING EVENTS FOR 2ND GENERATION
           INTEL® CORETM I7-2XXX, INTEL® CORETM I5-2XXX, INTEL® CORETM I3-2XXX
           PROCESSOR SERIES
2nd generation Intel® CoreTM i7-2xxx, Intel® CoreTM i5-2xxx, Intel® CoreTM i3-2xxx processor series are based on
the Intel microarchitecture code name Sandy Bridge. They support architectural performance-monitoring events
listed in Table 19-1. Non-architectural performance-monitoring events in the processor core are listed in Table
19-6, Table 19-7, and Table 19-8. The events in Table 19-6 apply to processors with CPUID signature of
DisplayFamily_DisplayModel encoding with the following values: 06_2AH and 06_2DH. The events in Table 19-7
apply to processors with CPUID signature 06_2AH. The events in Table 19-8 apply to processors with CPUID signa-
ture 06_2DH.




