                                                    boundary (page split), load accessing uncacheable
                                                    (UC or USWC) memory, load lock, and load with page
                                                    table in UC or USWC memory region.
06H      08H         STORE_BLOCKS.L1D_BLOCK         Cacheable loads delayed with L1D block code.
