                  _READS                  requests from a remote socket.
20H     08H       UNC_QHL_REQUESTS.REMOTE Counts number of Quickpath Home Logic write
                  _WRITES                 requests from a remote socket.
20H     10H       UNC_QHL_REQUESTS.LOCAL_      Counts number of Quickpath Home Logic read
                  READS                        requests from the local socket.
20H     20H       UNC_QHL_REQUESTS.LOCAL_      Counts number of Quickpath Home Logic write
                  WRITES                       requests from the local socket.
