2CH     01H       UNC_QMC_NORMAL_READS.C        Counts the number of Quickpath Memory Controller
                  H0                            channel 0 medium and low priority read requests. The
                                                QMC channel 0 normal read occupancy divided by this
                                                count provides the average QMC channel 0 read
                                                latency.
2CH     02H       UNC_QMC_NORMAL_READS.C        Counts the number of Quickpath Memory Controller
