19.7            PERFORMANCE MONITORING EVENTS FOR INTEL® XEON® PROCESSOR
                5200, 5400 SERIES AND INTEL® CORETM2 EXTREME PROCESSORS QX
                9000 SERIES
Processors based on the Enhanced Intel Core microarchitecture support the architectural and non-architectural
performance-monitoring events listed in Table 19-1 and Table 19-16. In addition, they also support the following
non-architectural performance-monitoring events listed in Table 19-14. Fixed counters support the architecture
events defined in Table 19-15.


