                                                        · request length
                                                        · memory type
                                                        · and sub-group consisting mostly of independent bits (bits 5, 6, 7,
                                                          8, 9, and 10)
                                                        Specify an encoding for each sub-group.
                  ESCR restrictions   MSR_BSU_ESCR0
