                                      0: REQ_TYPE0      Request type encoding (bit 0 and 1) are:
                                      1: REQ_TYPE1          0 ­ Read (excludes read invalidate)
                                                            1 ­ Read invalidate
                                                            2 ­ Write (other than writebacks)
                                                            3 ­ Writeback (evicted from cache). (public)
                                      2: REQ_LEN0       Request length encoding (bit 2, 3) are:
                                      3: REQ_LEN1           0 ­ 0 chunks
                                                            1 ­ 1 chunks
                                                            3 ­ 8 chunks




