                exiting              there are no other blocking of interrupts (see Section 24.4.2).
 3              Use TSC offsetting   This control determines whether executions of RDTSC, executions of RDTSCP, and executions
                                     of RDMSR that read from the IA32_TIME_STAMP_COUNTER MSR return a value modified by
                                     the TSC offset field (see Section 24.6.5 and Section 25.3).
 7              HLT exiting          This control determines whether executions of HLT cause VM exits.
 9              INVLPG exiting       This determines whether executions of INVLPG cause VM exits.
 10             MWAIT exiting        This control determines whether executions of MWAIT cause VM exits.
