 2                Save debug           This control determines whether DR7 and the IA32_DEBUGCTL MSR are saved on VM exit.
                  controls             The first processors to support the virtual-machine extensions supported only the 1-setting
                                       of this control.
 9                Host address-        On processors that support Intel 64 architecture, this control determines whether a logical
                  space size           processor is in 64-bit mode after the next VM exit. Its value is loaded into CS.L,
                                       IA32_EFER.LME, and IA32_EFER.LMA on every VM exit.1
                                       This control must be 0 on processors that do not support Intel 64 architecture.
 12               Load                 This control determines whether the IA32_PERF_GLOBAL_CTRL MSR is loaded on VM exit.
                  IA32_PERF_GLOB
                  AL_CTRL
