interfaces listed in Table 35-6, Table 35-7, plus additional MSR listed in Table 35-9. These MSRs also apply to Intel
Core i7, i5 and i3 processor family with CPUID signature DisplayFamily_DisplayModel of 06_25H and 06_2CH, see
