35.8        MSRS IN THE 3RD GENERATION INTEL® CORETM PROCESSOR FAMILY
            (BASED ON INTEL® MICROARCHITECTURE CODE NAME IVY BRIDGE)
The 3rd Generation Intel® CoreTM Processor Family (based on Intel® microarchitecture code name Ivy Bridge)
supports the MSR interfaces listed in Table 35-11, Table 35-12 and Table 35-14.


        Table 35-14. Additional MSRs Supported by 3rd Generation Intel® CoreTM Processors (Based on Intel®
                                   Microarchitecture Code Name Ivy Bridge)
    Register                                  Scope
