35.10.1 MSRs Unique to Intel® Xeon® Processor MP with L3 Cache
The MSRs listed in Table 35-17 apply to Intel Xeon Processor MP with up to 8MB level three cache. These processors
can be detected by enumerating the deterministic cache parameter leaf of CPUID instruction (with EAX = 4 as
input) to detect the presence of the third level cache, and with CPUID reporting family encoding 0FH, model
encoding 3 or 4 (see CPUID instruction for more details).


