35.12      MSRS IN THE PENTIUM M PROCESSOR
Model-specific registers (MSRs) for the Pentium M processor are similar to those described in Section 35.13 for P6
family processors. The following table describes new MSRs and MSRs whose behavior has changed on the Pentium
M processor.

